#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:5 dc9d31e99b25413b8b2ca0b116b03d8a
msgid "Failsafes"
msgstr "失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:7 31159c77f9f94c0694b86d27df0aadcf
msgid "Rover supports three failsafe mechanisms as described below."
msgstr "Rover 支持以下三种失控保护机制。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:10 b132c3ba1ebd470cbc9e54af31c6f842
msgid "Radio Failsafe (aka Throttle Failsafe)"
msgstr "遥控失控保护（又称油门失控保护）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:15 15dc2e2ad4b3414caf970b160802d277
msgid ""
"This failsafe is triggered if the connection between the user's transmitter "
"and the receiver on the vehicle is lost for at least :ref:`FS_TIMEOUT "
"<FS_TIMEOUT>` seconds."
msgstr "如果用户发射机与车辆接收机之间的连接中断时间超过 :ref:`FS_TIMEOUT <FS_TIMEOUT>` 秒，则触发此失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:17 51422a87fcfd4d169948639412d35fb7
msgid "the loss of transmitter/receiver connection is detected by:"
msgstr "发射机/接收机连接断开的检测方式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:19 d13f29ae4ece411eb1dc747029f13ae6
msgid "no signals being sent from the receiver to the autopilot board OR"
msgstr "接收机未向飞控飞控板发送信号，或"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:20 d2a805e647c744f19c7d07897b4ffc67
msgid ""
"the throttle channel (normally input channel 3) value falling below the "
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE <FS_THR_VALUE>` parameter value OR"
msgstr "油门通道（通常为输入通道 3）值低于 :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE <FS_THR_VALUE>` 参数值，或"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:21 1577730da1fe43eab38335f4301e4eaa
msgid ""
"RC_OVERRIDES are lost if :ref:`using a GCS only <common-gcs-only-operation>`"
" is being used,"
msgstr "如果正在 :ref:`仅使用 GCS <common-gcs-only-operation>`，则 RC_OVERRIDES 丢失，"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:23 7ac8bcc686c545eeb1cec43b8c09ae83
msgid "set :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE <FS_THR_ENABLE>` to \"1\" to enable this failsafe"
msgstr "将 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE <FS_THR_ENABLE>` 设置为「1」以启用此失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:24 44355fea80e34e7e8011c5fd851a675f
msgid ""
"if :ref:`FS_ACTION <FS_ACTION>` is \"1\", the vehicle will :ref:`RTL <rtl-"
"mode>` to home, if \"2\" the vehicle will :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`, if \"3\" "
"or \"4\" the vehicle will attempt to use :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` but"
" if this mode cannot be engaged the vehicle will :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` or "
":ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` respectively. If \"5\", it will Disarm."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`FS_ACTION <FS_ACTION>` 为「1」，车辆将执行 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` 返航；若为「2」则 "
":ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`；若为「3」或「4」，车辆将尝试使用 :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-"
"mode>`，若该模式无法激活则分别执行 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` 或 :ref:`Hold <hold-"
"mode>`。若为「5」则解除锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:25 80e7d8dbc2ac4546b1874e141d01705f
msgid ""
"once the transmitter/receiver connection is restored, the user must use the "
"transmitter's mode switch to re-take control of the vehicle in :ref:`Manual "
"<manual-mode>` (or any other mode)"
msgstr ""
"一旦发射机/接收机连接恢复，用户必须使用发射机的模式开关在 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` "
"（或任何其他模式）下重新接管车辆控制权"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:28 7a9a69d10d2f4e108eb122f4284dd1aa
msgid "Battery Failsafe"
msgstr "电池失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:32 95c9826fdd054206bec1b4f93a6146e6
msgid ""
"This failsafe requires the vehicle have a working :ref:`Power Module "
"<common-powermodule-landingpage>`."
msgstr "此失控保护要求飞行器配备可正常工作的 :ref:`电源模块 <common-powermodule-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:34 1ef516030562492dad6becd8d959cca0
msgid ""
"ArduPilot firmware versions 4.0 and later support up to 10 batteries/power "
"monitors. All the  discussion below applies to those optional batteries "
"also. Each can trigger a failsafe and each can have different actions and "
"setup values. In addition, a group of batteries can be treated as a single "
"unit, see ``BATTx_MONITOR`` = 10."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 固件 4.0 及更高版本支持最多 10 "
"块电池/电源监控器。以下所有说明同样适用于这些可选电池。每块电池均可触发失控保护，且可设置不同的动作和参数值。此外，一组电池可作为单个单元处理，参见 "
"``BATTx_MONITOR`` = 10。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:37 670fd797ef9c4355afdcc56286e3bb17
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "失控保护触发条件"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:39 1e07aa4fbfbf4483a18c5026c2ddb51b
msgid ""
"If enabled and set-up correctly the battery failsafe will trigger if the "
"main battery's"
msgstr "如果启用且设置正确，当主电池的以下情况发生时，电池失控保护将触发"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:41 db466763663b4b9fa351f3d990d2e3af
msgid ""
"voltage drops below the voltage held in the :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT "
"<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` parameter (or FS_BATT_VOLTAGE in older versions) for more "
"than 10 seconds. If set to zero (the default value) the voltage based "
"trigger will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"电压低于 :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` 参数（旧版本中为 FS_BATT_VOLTAGE）所设电压超过 10"
" 秒。若设为零（默认值），则禁用基于电压的触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:42 0e7c83bdf0e54439a27b6752ab626181
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"remaining capacity falls below the :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` "
"parameter (or FS_BATT_MAH in older versions) 20% of the battery's full "
"capacity is a good choice (i.e. \"1000\" for a 5000mAh battery).  If set to "
"zero (the default) the capacity based trigger will be disabled (i.e. only "
"voltage will be used)"
msgstr ""
"剩余容量低于 :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` 参数（旧版本中为 FS_BATT_MAH），建议设为电池满容量的 "
"20%（例如 5000mAh 电池设为「1000」）。若设为零（默认值），则禁用基于容量的触发（即仅使用电压触发）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:45 b98350c92e064692b63945ceff25f76e
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将会发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:47 92b17474ad9c4ae9a37cc0474c9fe4a8
msgid "When the failsafe is triggered:"
msgstr "触发失控保护时："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:49 74d2838b174147bbb9ec67421e8bbe18
msgid "Buzzer will play a loud low-battery alarm"
msgstr "蜂鸣器将发出响亮的低电量警报"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:50 52af50da4c9c4036af70601c8344d866
msgid "LEDs will flash yellow"
msgstr "LED 将闪烁黄色"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:51 5e6d616437064324b9b50fed97b958dd
msgid ""
"A warning message will be displayed on the ground station's HUD (if "
"telemetry is connected)"
msgstr "地面站 HUD 上将显示警告消息（如果已连接数传）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:52 104b42287fc24265ad1ba189a5c83160
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` configures the failsafe action to "
"take.  \"0\" to take no action (default), \"1\" to change into :ref:`RTL "
"<rtl-mode>`, \"2\" to change to :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`, if \"3\" or \"4\" "
"the vehicle will attempt to use :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` but if this "
"mode cannot be engaged the vehicle will :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` or :ref:`Hold "
"<hold-mode>` respectively.  \"5\" will disarm the vehicle."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` 配置失控保护动作。「0」为不采取任何行动（默认），「1」切换为 "
":ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`，「2」切换为 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`，若为「3」或「4」则尝试使用 "
":ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`，若该模式无法激活则分别执行 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` 或 "
":ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`。「5」将解除车辆锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:55 c04e7189fe5f43f4861ee3512eedc05e
msgid "Two-Stage Battery Failsafe"
msgstr "两级电池失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:57 441d8bfc7a5c40baa2cdc923564fd890
msgid ""
"Rover also includes a two-layer battery failsafe.  This allows setting up a "
"follow-up action if the battery voltage or remaining capacity falls below an"
" even lower threshold."
msgstr "Rover 还包含两级电池失控保护。这允许在电池电压或剩余容量低于更低阈值时设置后续动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:59 5878bd3d6e3245c6bad6749b0a549e7e
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` - holds the secondary (lower) voltage "
"threshold.  Set to zero to disable. Default is zero."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` - 设置二级（较低）电压阈值。设为零则禁用。默认值为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:60 4e9a711ad440435fba52ace7293ef41d
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>` - holds the secondary (lower) capacity "
"threshold.  Set to zero to disable. Default is zero."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>` - 设置二级（较低）容量阈值。设为零则禁用。默认值为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:61 09e8a18f24e043b39d5900cfaa1a6f89
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` - holds the secondary action to "
"take. It has the same options and default as :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` — 保存次级动作。其选项和默认值与 "
":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` 相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:64 2741e6f28ecb4152bad3a4c2e0264718
msgid "Advanced Battery Failsafe Settings"
msgstr "高级电池失控保护设置"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:66 3ec1c2bc1e244b95aca0ef468bdd6f69
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_VOLTSRC <BATT_FS_VOLTSRC>` allows configuring whether the raw "
"battery voltage or a sag corrected voltage is used"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_FS_VOLTSRC <BATT_FS_VOLTSRC>` 允许配置使用原始电池电压还是压降校正后的电压"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:67 8d2add65190d4cbea109a6033384992a
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_LOW_TIMER <BATT_LOW_TIMER>` can configure how long the voltage "
"must be below the threshold for the failsafe to trigger (10 sec default)"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_LOW_TIMER <BATT_LOW_TIMER>` 可配置电压低于阈值多长时间后触发失控保护（默认 10 秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:68 c7e85d3703f14574b2a3edb023fbb197
msgid ""
"``BATTx_`` parameters can be setup to trigger the failsafe on other "
"batteries"
msgstr "``BATTx_`` 参数可用于为其他电池设置失控保护触发"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:71 ced74f7288634208aa366bd3b8873e06
msgid "GCS Failsafe (aka Telemetry Failsafe)"
msgstr "GCS 失控保护（又称数传失控保护）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:74 d4fb664d9b56455ebf71438613d52d83
msgid "Prior to Rover-4.4"
msgstr "Rover-4.4 之前版本"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:76 c34df34dd63347d2a7bd4378251af2ef
msgid ""
"This failsafe is triggered if the vehicle stops receiving `heartbeat "
"messages <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ from the "
"ground station for at least :ref:`FS_TIMEOUT <FS_TIMEOUT>` seconds."
msgstr ""
"如果车辆停止接收来自地面站的 `心跳消息 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ 超过 "
":ref:`FS_TIMEOUT <FS_TIMEOUT>` 秒，则触发此失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:79 b4d00b20026547b6830e430e0bcaa90e
msgid "Starting from Rover-4.4"
msgstr "从 Rover-4.4 开始"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:81 07503739749449aca64edb44861887e5
msgid ""
"Significant improvements have been made in Rover-4.4 and later for Ground "
"Control Failsafe ."
msgstr "Rover-4.4 及更高版本对地面控制失控保护进行了重大改进。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:83 fbbab30bcbb34909a373adca211f6b83
msgid ""
"The Ground Station Control (GCS) failsafe controls how Rover will behave if "
"contact with the GCS is lost. The GCS failsafe monitors the time since the "
"last MAVLink heartbeat from the GCS. If no heartbeat is received "
":ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT <FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` seconds (Default is 5 seconds), the "
"GCS failsafe event will trigger based on your parameter settings. Note that "
"if no GCS is ever connected, the GCS failsafe will remain inactive "
"regardless of parameter settings."
msgstr ""
"地面控制站（GCS）失控保护控制在与 GCS 失去联系时 Rover 的行为。GCS 失控保护监控自上次收到 GCS 的 MAVLink "
"心跳以来的时间。如果超过 :ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT <FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` 秒（默认为 5 秒）未收到心跳，则 GCS "
"失控保护事件将根据您的参数设置触发。请注意，如果从未连接过 GCS，则无论参数如何设置，GCS 失控保护都将保持非激活状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:87 775d582ccfcc416fa682b1a110c17cd7
msgid "Enabling the failsafe in all versions"
msgstr "在所有版本中启用失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:89 e930ed1033e542fda21163a768c69f08
msgid ""
"In parameters list, set the :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE <FS_GCS_ENABLE>` parameter "
"to:"
msgstr "在参数列表中，将 :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE <FS_GCS_ENABLE>` 参数设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:91 77854fe8543546deb0e6ba04a2ac454f
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the GCS failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用** （值 0）将完全禁用 GCS 失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:92 aa2269862bab4698806dd46697300336
msgid ""
"**Enabled** (Value 1) will execute the FS_ACTION when Failsafe trigger."
msgstr "**启用** （值 1）将在失控保护触发时执行 FS_ACTION。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:93 03a807f17b104a81ba17c204d7543986
msgid ""
"**Enabled Continue with Mission in Auto Mode** (Value 2) will ignore the "
"failsafe in an Auto Mode mission."
msgstr "**启用并在 Auto 模式中继续任务** （值 2）将在 Auto 模式任务中忽略失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:95 4f53c519fa6f42afa1f18cdfc7cc1351
msgid ""
"The action done on GCS Failsafe is controlled by the :ref:`FS_ACTION "
"<FS_ACTION>` parameter:"
msgstr "GCS 失控保护触发时的动作由 :ref:`FS_ACTION <FS_ACTION>` 参数控制："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:97 cb0b7030a79642d493aed4f04ea99187
msgid "**Nothing** (Value O) will do nothing."
msgstr "**无操作** （值 0）将不执行任何动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:98 14c11337ab654ba9890e871d661257dd
msgid "**RTL** (Value 1) will active RTL to go home."
msgstr "**RTL** （值 1）将激活 RTL 返回起始点。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:99 3b1ccaf304664753a93d7918ce91d493
msgid "**Hold** (Value 2) will active Hold Mode and stay in place."
msgstr "**Hold** （值 2）将激活 Hold 模式并原地停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:100 8359eddb91f743a98ebadb265d74f09e
msgid ""
"**SmartRTL or RTL** (Value 3) will active SmartRTL mode to go back home or "
"RTL if SmartRTL doesn't work."
msgstr "**SmartRTL 或 RTL** （值 3）将激活 SmartRTL 模式返回起始点，若 SmartRTL 不可用则执行 RTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:101 c4625e2c7cee4f1685e1540645e82819
msgid ""
"**SmartRTL or Hold** (Value 4)  will active SmartRTL mode to go back home or"
" Hold mode if Smart RTL doesn't work."
msgstr ""
"**SmartRTL 或 Hold** （值 4）将激活 SmartRTL 模式返回起始点，若 SmartRTL 不可用则执行 Hold 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:103 62f666f6d5a54a7ea4f98ea36a01040c
msgid ""
"You must use the transmitter's mode switch to re-take control of the vehicle"
" in :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` (or any other mode), or change modes with "
"the GCS itself, if communication is re-established."
msgstr ""
"通信恢复后，您必须使用发射机的模式开关在 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` （或任何其他模式）下重新接管车辆控制权，或通过 GCS"
" 本身切换模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:107 06eceea2ce03482a86769ecda04002ac
msgid "Crash Check"
msgstr "坠机检测"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:109 3840ecd1dacb47b59639ec4fa5a23121
msgid ""
"If enabled by setting the :ref:`FS_CRASH_CHECK <FS_CRASH_CHECK>` parameter "
"to \"1\" (for :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`) or \"2\" (for :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`"
" and Disarm) this failsafe will switch the vehicle to Hold and then "
"(optionally) disarm the vehicle if all the following are true for at least 2"
" seconds:"
msgstr ""
"如果通过将 :ref:`FS_CRASH_CHECK <FS_CRASH_CHECK>` 参数设置为「1」（执行 :ref:`Hold <hold-"
"mode>`）或「2」（执行 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` 并解锁）启用此功能，当以下所有条件持续至少 2 秒时，失控保护将切换车辆至"
" Hold 模式，然后（可选）解除锁定："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:111 247d80cedd86463682aac04d33ee6f8f
msgid ""
"the vehicle is in :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`, :ref:`Guided <guided-mode>`, "
":ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` or :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` mode"
msgstr ""
"车辆处于 :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`、:ref:`Guided <guided-mode>`、:ref:`RTL <rtl-"
"mode>` 或 :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:112 98a2354f9f4c45a48a6484e14e7f36a7
msgid "velocity falls below 0.08m/s (i.e. 8cm/s)"
msgstr "速度低于 0.08m/s（即 8cm/s）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:113 7d2b8732089c438e98c200c208188664
msgid "the vehicle is turning at less than 4.5 deg/s"
msgstr "车辆转向角速度低于 4.5 度/秒"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:114 b7ba2b5545534be4a0448af8892a0e36
msgid ""
"demanded throttle to the motors (from the pilot or autopilot) is at least 5%"
msgstr "飞手或飞控请求的电机油门至少为 5%"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:116 4f73edf0b8664d2d996945e67e4795a3
msgid ""
"In addition, the :ref:`CRASH_ANGLE <CRASH_ANGLE>` parameter immediately "
"enables the same actions above if the vehicle's roll or pitch angle exceeds "
"that value. \"0\" disables this check."
msgstr ""
"此外，若车辆横滚或俯仰角超过 :ref:`CRASH_ANGLE <CRASH_ANGLE>` 参数值，将立即触发上述相同动作。「0」禁用此检测。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:119 54f954c3c22544b8bc81d007826306fd
msgid "Hold Mode Failsafes"
msgstr "Hold 模式失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-failsafes.rst:121 c83d7696cdd745ab9d72cb74d1fa3e8e
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` bitmask parameter determines if failsafes "
"will be recognized while in HOLD Mode. If bit 0 is set, then failsafes will "
"be recognized and acted upon. If not, failsafes will be ignored in HOLD mode"
" (default)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 位掩码参数决定在 Hold 模式下是否识别失控保护。若第 0 "
"位置位，则识别并执行失控保护动作；否则在 Hold 模式下忽略失控保护（默认）。"

